{
  "title": "Quick Spicy Australian Beef Stew",
  "description": "Rich, creamy, and flavorful Australian-style beef stew, perfect for a sick day. Cooked in a kadhai with a mix of grilled and jerk-seasoned beef.",
  "cuisine": "Australian",
  "diet": [
    "whole30-friendly"
